  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/b7b71fcbd8bc982dfd7b31b851ee352e5355d24b.png\" alt=\"標題\"> 來自 MBCMechachu 的 Cobblemon 圖示，適用於 Xaero 的小地圖！</p><h2>展示</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/bd65a01d7a2db0de69f4c440a2c3724012cff6cd.png\" alt=\"閃光標記\"></p><ul>\n<li>包含無標記的閃光版本。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/f8c9f4a61e380e52553d7c79cf8707c1a7e26cd6.png\" alt=\"裝飾品\"></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252f45NQR5l\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">完整裝飾品清單</a></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/8db192c9d54be8f2f7d8ba8b5b4d14fd2efda818.png\" alt=\"物種多樣性\"></p><ul>\n<li>支援所有 Cobblemon 型態變化。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/a4d77bf9445015c7055da9217a6c9df0b4ffd3a4.png\" alt=\"附加支援\"></p><ul>\n<li>支援的附加內容清單。</li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\"><strong>官方</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcombee-mc-remodel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combee MC Remodel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fvivillon-pride-patterns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vivillon Pride Patterns</a></li>\n</ul>\n<strong>自創寶可夢</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-alatias-fakemon-pack-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alatia's Fakemon</a></li>\n</ul>\n<strong>寶可夢擴展</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fallthemons\" rel=\"nofollow\">AllTheMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fallthemons-x-mega-showdown-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AllTheMons x Mega Showdown</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/radiants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AllTheMons x Mega Showdown Radiants</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alphabet-soup\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alphabet Soup</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ascension-megamons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ascension Megamons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fbaby-legends-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Baby Legends</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcloudmons\" rel=\"nofollow\">CloudMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cobble-cats\" rel=\"nofollow\">CobbleCats</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobbled-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobbled Variants</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/cobblecafe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon Cafe</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobblemon-exploration-day\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon: Exploration Day</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cobblemon-mc-swords-for-honedge-line\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon: MC Swords for Honedge Line</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-mega-showdown\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon: Mega Showdown</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcolorable-forretress-shulker-boxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colorable Forretress Shulker Boxes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobblemon-eternal-floette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eternal Floette</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fflower-expansion-cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flower Expansion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgenomons\" rel=\"nofollow\">GenoMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fgholdengo-shiny-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gholdengo Shiny Fix</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fhiddenmons-cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">HiddenMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fhydro-reanimodel-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hydro's Reanimodel Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fkales-cobblemon-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kale's Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flackingmons\" rel=\"nofollow\">LackingMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/official-missingmons-cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">MissingMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmoremons\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmundialmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MundialMons ReaniPack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmysticmons\" rel=\"nofollow\">MysticMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fnavas-zamega\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Navas' ZAmega</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fnotsocobblemon-allones-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">NotSoCobblemon Allone's Additions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fodysseymons\" rel=\"nofollow\">OdysseyMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fpigeons-poke-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pigeon's PokePack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobblemon-pokemans\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemans Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252frotom-appliances\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rotom Appliances</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsaltmons\" rel=\"nofollow\">SaltMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fthe-jewel-pokmon-cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Jewel Pokemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ftorterras-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torterras O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fwavimons-(cobblemon)\" rel=\"nofollow\">WaviMons</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/00013aeb6299b53acfa5f602d74297b7bc20b9c1.png\" alt=\"大圖示版本\"></p><ul>\n<li>大圖示版本即將推出。</li>\n</ul><h2>使用指南</h2><p><strong>保持實體圖示可見</strong></p><ul>\n<li>進入你的世界，按下「Y」鍵開啟「小地圖設定」。</li>\n<li>選擇「實體雷達設定」。</li>\n<li>將「顯示圖示」更改為「總是」。</li>\n<li>將「實體圖示比例」調整到適合你的大小。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>僅顯示寶可夢圖示</strong></p><ul>\n<li>進入 .minecraft/config/xaero/minimap 資料夾，開啟 \"default_radar_categories_client.json\"。</li>\n<li>將 <code>\"hardInclude\": \"anything\"</code> 替換為 <code>\"hardInclude\": \"nothing\"</code></li>\n<li>將 <code>\"includeList\": []</code> 替換為 <code>\"includeList\": [\"cobblemon:pokemon\"]</code></li>\n</ul><p><strong>與其他資源包搭配使用</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcombee-mc-remodel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combee MC Remodel</a> 應放在此資源包之上。</li>\n<li>所有其他資源包應放在此資源包之下。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/aae9bf9d71bdbcbc9af8e0f2b39437ab23838844.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"668\" height=\"816\"></p><h2>致謝</h2><ul>\n<li>大部分寶可夢精靈圖來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.deviantart.com%252fmbcmechachu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MBCMechachu</a>。</li>\n<li>新的 Indigo Disk 寶可夢精靈圖來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.deviantart.com%252fezerart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ezerart</a>。</li>\n</ul><p><code>如有任何錯誤或遺漏的寶可夢，歡迎留言！</code></p>",
